              calculation: field_GreenUpgradesPremium_BOPIncreasedCostOfLossAndRelatedExpensesForGreenUpgradesBldg + field_RelatedExpensesPremium_BOPIncreasedCostOfLossAndRelatedExpensesForGreenUpgradesBldg + field_PeriodOfRestorationPremium_BOPIncreasedCostOfLossAndRelatedExpensesForGreenUpgradesBldg
